> - 对象类：实心矩形/solid_rectangle, 尾部向量/tail_vector, 实心条/solid_bar, 菱形轮廓/diamond_outline, 圆角边框/rounded_frame, 内部图案/inner_pattern, 精灵体/sprite, 象限/quadrant, 缺陷条/defect_bar, 面板/panel, 符号掩码/symbol_mask, 线段/segment, 条带/stripe, 色段/color_run, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 阴影像素/shadow_pixel, 瓦片/tile, 种子像素/seed_pixel, 障碍像素/obstacle_pixel, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 小方块/small_square, 路径网络/path_network, 中心枢纽/hub_square, 种子区域/seed_region, 多色精灵体/multicolor_sprite, 边界锚点/border_anchor, 分隔列/separator_column, 等宽面板/equal_width_panel, 菱形框/diamond_frame, 侧标记/side_marker, 阻挡像素/blocker_pixel, 矩形/rectangle, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 干扰体/distractor, 对角周期图案/diagonal_periodic_pattern, 背景通道/background_corridor, 杂色前景/clutter_foreground, 边缘源像素/edge_source_pixel, 同色端点/same_color_endpoint, 空心矩形/hollow_rect
> - 空间关系类：尾部指示位移/tail_displacement, 中心对称/center_symmetry, 归一化到固定尺寸/normalize_size, 旋转对称/rotational_symmetry, 所属面板/panel_membership, 对齐/alignment, 逐行递增/row_by_row_increment, 偏移/offset, 行传播/row_propagation, 接触边决定投影/contact_det_project, 邻接传色/adjacency_color_transfer, 颜色匹配锚点/color_match_anchor, 逐格比较/cell_comparison, 框内填充/fill_inside_frame, 邻接/adjacency, 对角线同余/diagonal_residue, 区域包含/region_containment, 同色配对/same_color_matching, 内部区域/interior_region
> - 条件/判断类：尾部决定平移/tail_determines_shift, 逐步收缩/stepwise_shrink, 对角放置/diagonal_placement, 对侧面板色/opposite_panel_color, 符号映射颜色/symbol_to_color_mapping, 按长度递增堆叠/stacked_by_increasing_length, 每行递增扩展/row_incremental_expand, 列环绕/column_wrapping, 碰撞产生侧翼/collision_generates_side_wakes, 颜色决定投影深度/color_det_depth, 邻接计数决定色/adjacency_count_determines_color, 边缘位置决定轴/edge_position_determines_axis, 双空交集涂色/intersect_empty_fill, 遇阻停止/stop_at_blocker, 邻接不足则删除/delete_unsupported, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 对角周期补缺失/missing_by_diagonal_cycle, 长矩形通道涂色/long_rectangular_corridors_filled, 有端点则转弯/endpoint_triggers_turn, 无端点则延伸/no_endpoint_extends, 标记框内保护/marker_bbox_protect, 提取原始瓦片/extract_source_tile
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

